OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1788286801
OL,3,CAgeing island leisure centre 'not fit
OL,4,Cfor future' and requires 'major' refurb
OL,6,FGuernsey's largest public leisure
OL,7,Fcentre is not fit for the future and
OL,8,Fneeds either a 'major refurbishment'
OL,9,For a rebuild, according to a new
OL,10,Freport.
OL,12,FThe Beau Sejour Sustainability Review,
OL,13,Fcommissioned by the States of
OL,14,FGuernsey, assessed the centre's
OL,15,Fcurrent benefits to the community and
OL,16,Fidentified what needs to be done to
OL,17,Fsafeguard the facility's future.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/4
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1788286801
OL,3,CAgeing island leisure centre 'not fit
OL,4,Cfor future' and requires 'major' refurb
OL,6,FIt found the building is ageing,
OL,7,Ffacilities are nearing the end of
OL,8,Ftheir life, and simply patching it up
OL,9,Fwould risk a managed decline.
OL,11,FHowever, it found the centre is still
OL,12,Fhighly valued, generating an estimated
OL,13,Fsocial value of around #1.4 million a
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,16,FThe report also highlighted that
OL,17,Fclosing the site was not an option -
OL,18,Fwith a push to create a broader
OL,19,Fwellbeing campus.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/4
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
