OL,3,CAgeing island leisure centre 'not fit
OL,4,Cfor future' and requires 'major' refurb
OL,6,FThe review summarises that there is a
OL,7,Fclear case for change, with Deputy
OL,8,FPaul Montague, President of the
OL,9,FCommittee for Education, Sport and
OL,10,FCulture, saying Beau Sejour needs to
OL,11,Fbe modernised with "significant"
OL,12,Fpublic funding.
OL,14,F"The Centre has been improved and
OL,15,Fpatched up incrementally over the
OL,16,Fyears, but we've now reached the point
OL,17,Fwhere something more significant is
OL,18,Fundeniably required," he explained.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/4
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1788286801
OL,3,CAgeing island leisure centre 'not fit
OL,4,Cfor future' and requires 'major' refurb
OL,6,F"This also reflects a bigger
OL,7,Fcrossroads for Guernsey. We need to
OL,8,Flook carefully at our major public
OL,9,Fbuildings and think radically about
OL,10,Fhow the island's facilities can be
OL,11,Fmade fit for the future, and this
OL,12,FCommittee is determined to take on
OL,13,Fthat challenge.
OL,15,F"There is a real, evidenced need for
OL,16,Finvestment, and simply doing nothing
OL,17,Fis not a viable long-term strategy."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/4
